{"seq":2,"slug":"mod-dependencies","title":"依赖与加载顺序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/ecosystem/mod-dependencies","wordCount":1566,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"依赖与加载顺序\">依赖与加载顺序</h1><p>一个天际玩家装了两百个 mod，开局却直接崩溃——问题往往不在任何单个 mod，而在它们被加载的顺序。mod B 覆盖了某条记录，mod A 也覆盖了同一条，谁后加载谁说了算；而 mod B 又依赖 mod C 必须先就位。当 mod 数量上百，手动排序就成了不可能任务。本篇讲依赖图、拓扑排序，以及 LOOT 那套把这件事自动化的学问。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>多 mod 共存的核心问题是「顺序决定语义」。加载顺序同时承担两件事：一是依赖满足（被依赖的 mod 必须先加载），二是覆盖仲裁（同一资源被多个 mod 改动时，后加载者覆盖先加载者）。把所有 mod 之间的依赖与冲突关系建成一张有向图，求一个满足所有约束的线性顺序——这就是拓扑排序问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[收集所有 Mod&lt;br/&gt;读各自清单依赖] --&gt; B[构建依赖有向图&lt;br/&gt;节点=mod 边=依赖/优先]&#10;    B --&gt; C{图中有环?}&#10;    C --&gt;|有| D[报告循环依赖&lt;br/&gt;无法满足]&#10;    C --&gt;|无| E[拓扑排序&lt;br/&gt;求线性加载序]&#10;    E --&gt; F[应用覆盖优先级&lt;br/&gt;后加载者胜]&#10;    F --&gt; G[检测剩余冲突&lt;br/&gt;同记录被多 mod 改]&#10;    G --&gt; H[加载并挂载到 VFS]&#10;    D --&gt; I[提示用户修复]\">flowchart TD\n    A[收集所有 Mod&lt;br/&gt;读各自清单依赖] --&gt; B[构建依赖有向图&lt;br/&gt;节点=mod 边=依赖/优先]\n    B --&gt; C{图中有环?}\n    C --&gt;|有| D[报告循环依赖&lt;br/&gt;无法满足]\n    C --&gt;|无| E[拓扑排序&lt;br/&gt;求线性加载序]\n    E --&gt; F[应用覆盖优先级&lt;br/&gt;后加载者胜]\n    F --&gt; G[检测剩余冲突&lt;br/&gt;同记录被多 mod 改]\n    G --&gt; H[加载并挂载到 VFS]\n    D --&gt; I[提示用户修复]</pre><p>依赖关系有几种类型，含义不同。下表对比 mod 清单里常见的依赖声明。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关系类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>对加载序的约束</th>\n<th>缺失时行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>硬依赖（requires）</td>\n<td>必须有且先加载</td>\n<td>强制偏序 A→B</td>\n<td>拒绝加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软依赖（after）</td>\n<td>若存在则在其后加载</td>\n<td>条件偏序</td>\n<td>忽略，正常加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冲突（conflicts）</td>\n<td>不能与某 mod 共存</td>\n<td>互斥</td>\n<td>拒绝或警告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖优先（load after）</td>\n<td>排在某 mod 之后以胜出覆盖</td>\n<td>偏序仅为仲裁</td>\n<td>忽略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"依赖图与拓扑排序-算法的核心\">依赖图与拓扑排序：算法的核心</h2><p>把每个 mod 看作图的节点，把「A 必须在 B 之前加载」这类约束看作有向边 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\to B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，整个 mod 集合就是一张有向图。一个合法的加载顺序，等价于这张图的拓扑排序——一个线性序列，使每条边的起点都排在终点之前。</p>\n<p>经典的 Kahn 算法可在线性时间求解：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def topo_sort(mods, edges):&#10;    indeg = {m: 0 for m in mods}&#10;    for u, v in edges:          # 边 u-&gt;v 表示 u 必须在 v 前&#10;        indeg[v] += 1&#10;    ready = [m for m in mods if indeg[m] == 0]  # 入度为 0 的可先加载&#10;    order = []&#10;    while ready:&#10;        m = ready.pop()&#10;        order.append(m)&#10;        for v in succ[m]:&#10;            indeg[v] -= 1&#10;            if indeg[v] == 0:&#10;                ready.append(v)&#10;    if len(order) != len(mods):&#10;        raise CyclicDependency()  # 还有节点没排完 = 存在环&#10;    return order\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> topo_sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mods, edges):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    indeg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {m: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mods}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> u, v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> edges:          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 边 u->v 表示 u 必须在 v 前</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        indeg[v] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ready </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mods </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> indeg[m] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 入度为 0 的可先加载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ready:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ready.pop()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        order.append(m)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> succ[m]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            indeg[v] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> indeg[v] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                ready.append(v)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mods):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        raise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CyclicDependency()  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 还有节点没排完 = 存在环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order</span></span></code></pre></div><p>算法的复杂度是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(V + E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是 mod 数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 是依赖边数。它顺带解决了循环依赖检测：若排完后仍有节点入度非零，说明图里有环——mod A 依赖 B、B 又依赖 A，这是无解的，必须报告给用户而非默默乱排。</p>\n<h2 id=\"循环依赖与冲突仲裁-拓扑排序解决不了的部分\">循环依赖与冲突仲裁：拓扑排序解决不了的部分</h2><p>拓扑排序给出的是「满足依赖」的顺序，但它本身可能有多个合法解，而覆盖仲裁要求在多个合法解里选对的那个。考虑两个 mod 都修改同一条天际的 NPC 记录、彼此又无依赖关系——拓扑排序认为任意顺序都合法，但玩家其实想要其中一个特定 mod 的改动胜出。</p>\n<p>这就是「覆盖冲突」：依赖图没有约束，但语义上有偏好。解决它需要额外的优先级元数据（哪个 mod 该排在后面以胜出），这正是 LOOT 主列表（masterlist）存在的理由。形式化地说，拓扑排序给出约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>≺</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\prec_{dep}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8252em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\">≺</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 下的所有合法序，覆盖仲裁再用偏好关系 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>≺</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\prec_{pref}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8252em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\">≺</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在其中挑选：最终序必须同时满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>≺</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\prec_{dep}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8252em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\">≺</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（硬约束）与尽量多的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>≺</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\prec_{pref}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8252em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\">≺</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（软偏好）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"loot-把社区知识沉淀成主列表\">LOOT：把社区知识沉淀成主列表</h2><p>Bethesda 系游戏（天际、辐射、星空）的 mod 生态规模巨大，社区为此造了 LOOT（Load Order Optimisation Tool）。据 LOOT 文档，它提供自动化、可定制的加载顺序排序，排序时还检查加载顺序错误（如不兼容与缺失依赖），并用主列表（masterlist）数据建议最优顺序（来源：LOOT 文档）。</p>\n<p>LOOT 的精髓在于：很多覆盖偏好无法从 mod 文件本身推断，只能靠社区经验积累——「这两个 mod 同时装时，A 必须排在 B 后面才不冲突」。这种知识被沉淀进一份社区维护的 masterlist 元数据，LOOT 把它和玩家本地的 mod 列表合并，算出推荐顺序。据相关文档，决定加载顺序的信息来自三处：插件文件扩展名、插件头部、以及 LOOT 元数据（来源：Plugin Load Order, Modding.wiki）。值得一提的是，星空引入的新插件头标志在 2025 年被从 &quot;override&quot; 改名为 &quot;overlay&quot;，与 xEdit、Wrye Bash、Mod Organizer 2 保持一致（来源：xEdit 文档 2025）——可见这套元数据契约本身也在持续演化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"加载顺序如何牵连其余系统\">加载顺序如何牵连其余系统</h2><p>加载顺序不是孤立的算法题，它是 mod 生态的中枢，向外牵连三处。向上，它决定了 <a href=\"../extension/asset-pipeline-mods\">Mod 资产管线</a> 里 VFS 的挂载优先级——后加载的 mod 挂在更高优先级，其资源覆盖先加载者。向左，它决定了 <a href=\"../extension/mod-api-design\">Mod API 设计</a> 里事件回调的触发顺序——多个 mod 订阅同一事件时，加载序往往就是回调序。向前，依赖关系一旦遇上游戏更新（某依赖 mod 失效），整张依赖图可能崩塌，这是 <a href=\"mod-version-compat\">版本兼容</a> 要处理的问题。这种「对象图 + 引用解析」的结构，与存档系统的对象图引用是同类问题，跨库见 <a href=\"../../game-save-serialization/techniques/streaming-large-worlds\">对象图与引用</a> 一脉的序列化思路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>多 mod 共存的核心是「顺序决定语义」：加载序同时承担依赖满足（被依赖者先加载）与覆盖仲裁（后加载者胜）。</li>\n<li>把依赖建成有向图，合法加载序即拓扑排序；Kahn 算法 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(V+E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 求解并顺带检测循环依赖（无解须报告而非乱排）。</li>\n<li>依赖分硬依赖/软依赖/冲突/覆盖优先四类，约束强度不同。</li>\n<li>拓扑排序只保证满足依赖，覆盖冲突（无依赖但有偏好）需额外优先级元数据仲裁。</li>\n<li>LOOT 把无法从文件推断的覆盖偏好沉淀成社区 masterlist，与本地列表合并算出推荐序；元数据契约本身也在演化（如星空 override→overlay）。</li>\n<li>加载序是生态中枢：决定 VFS 覆盖优先级、事件回调顺序，并在游戏更新时牵连依赖图崩塌。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>加载序即 VFS 覆盖优先级：<a href=\"../extension/asset-pipeline-mods\">Mod 资产管线</a></li>\n<li>加载序即事件回调顺序：<a href=\"../extension/mod-api-design\">Mod API 设计</a></li>\n<li>更新导致依赖崩塌：<a href=\"mod-version-compat\">版本兼容</a></li>\n<li>跨库：对象图与引用的序列化：<a href=\"../../game-save-serialization/techniques/streaming-large-worlds\">流式大世界</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"依赖与加载顺序","id":"依赖与加载顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖图与拓扑排序：算法的核心","id":"依赖图与拓扑排序-算法的核心"},{"level":2,"text":"循环依赖与冲突仲裁：拓扑排序解决不了的部分","id":"循环依赖与冲突仲裁-拓扑排序解决不了的部分"},{"level":2,"text":"LOOT：把社区知识沉淀成主列表","id":"loot-把社区知识沉淀成主列表"},{"level":2,"text":"加载顺序如何牵连其余系统","id":"加载顺序如何牵连其余系统"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"分发与 Workshop","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/ecosystem/mod-distribution"},"next":{"title":"版本兼容","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/ecosystem/mod-version-compat"}}